# At twice the size a cell is 16 pixels wide and a row 44 high, so the text
# begins at x = 7 * 16 = 112 and "def" is in the keyword colour from there, and
# not where it was at x = 56 to 112, now the gutter. The status line, a row
# high, is at y = 640 - 44 = 596.
# files s.cm=def f:
# open s.cm
# frames 3
# expect scale 2
# pixels 112 0 960 44 204 168 239 some
# pixels 56 0 112 44 204 168 239 none
# pixels 0 596 960 640 35 40 48 some
# pixels 0 574 960 596 35 40 48 none
1 key = ctrl
